    "detailed_description": "\u25a0Story<br />\r\nAn ordinary school girl, &quot;Ryo=Rurube&quot;, suddenly...<br />\r\nShe has transformed into her transformation battle heroine &quot;Fresh Charge RURU&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProtect the peace of the city from the clutches of the evil army &quot;BELF&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet's go! RURU!<br />\r\nKick away evil with your natural energy and deadly flying kicks!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Game system<br />\r\n\u30fbEasy-to-operate turn-based action<br />\r\nNo complicated operations required! Just decide the direction of your flying kick and shoot it.<br />\r\nExhilarating side-view action where you can scatter enemies in all directions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbGrowth elements with abundant techniques and strengthening items<br />\r\nFreely acquire skills by allocating &quot;Build Pnt.&quot; obtained by leveling up.<br />\r\nCombine with strengthening items and take on difficult stages and giant bosses with the most optimal build!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb2D characters that move smoothly<br />\r\nCharacters move smoothly using a technology called &quot;2D Animation&quot;.<br />\r\nLet's enjoy the action and story woven by such characters!",
